This is a placeholder application entry. Its slug ("example-demo") matches the
directory name under `public/files/c64/example-demo/` — that convention is
required for file lookups to work.

Replace this entry (or add new ones) with your own software. Required fields:

- `name` — display name
- `platform` — must match a slug in `src/content/platforms/`
- `shortDescription` — one-line summary shown on cards and in the Assembly64 client
- `date` — optional `YYYY-MM-DD` release date

Optional fields: `featureImage`, `featureImageCaption`, `githubRepo`.
